      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了参加“皋月赏”，\n醒目飞鹰不断地进行练习。\n但是却一直没有明显的进步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "387b2d529f1fcda8bcd4922dabdf75d360cac0d076a84aec17d32b883caa87eb",
