      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是她便决定向在草地赛道表现活跃的\n无声铃鹿寻求协助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e9c8b41889434a4b4127c690c6575ef6b2b0aa52344a84ae5c60f8150297c13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
