    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aa28837a547b954389c2b87",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿无论是跑法还是歌声\n皆令观众着迷。她也是醒目飞鹰\n所追求的理想人物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d4707b6ad0a4d69684cd73fc37a30a6182841cd215ba032a37be0d1f65f29c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
