      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在向无声铃鹿讨教的过程中，\n醒目飞鹰对皋月赏的意念\n也变得更强烈了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "334ea4fc1c5033ce4299abfd6adf55d8448de35d198d7d3fdeb9dbddf1bee511",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
