    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:906349b9f9a7fbe29f1ab38e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "年末的大奖赛“有马纪念”。\n与训练员一起前去观赛的醒目飞鹰，\n对其热烈的气氛感到十分震撼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ff7760f3308f464eaac7d4c8eda4e7630f2799ffaea8a5ee2d999d884542689",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046404.json",
      "json_path": [
