      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62035786820e65ae1eb5ce7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大和赤骥在竞赛中获得胜利。\n由她担任C位的胜者舞台呈现了\n十分精彩的盛况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "05246b1c0050d23a63ee08d643a2b99e10f3f1c1b017a6031834df973468ec3b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b354d3f2a419264e05c84759",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最前排观赏了演唱会的醒目飞鹰，\n决定下次参加“东京大赏典”时\n也要让气氛变得一样热烈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b9a3cd318d88ae40bd9c32e3bed8e3eee34d028b3eb6e041577ed9ff3470098",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b4027fbcb40e43481e843fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "沙土竞赛也很有趣。\n无论是宣传还是演唱会，她能做的事都做了。\n她告诉自己，一定不会有问题──",
      "source_fingerprint": "69f53d68f6c7a0ef571d8cf12a68de8197990792103ba15948264e2965a3e114",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60084d5925c7a77dcda0c224",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "NEXT☆GP女孩！",
      "source_fingerprint": "879aaec49390bbcded205168ea3f460b78422c67c3f7954e12d885aeb157104f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046404.json",
