    {
      "uid": "zhcn:077ca2929b4ae5a273abc90e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰说有重大消息要发表，\n便聚集观众举办了小型演唱会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0224809972e9e3ee2e18c49f553d88619917897e39055ea986cb4a83e994b73f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046405.json",
      "json_path": [
