      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04eb002d96d3231f799632d9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但醒目飞鹰因为忙着应付采访，\n错失了确认这段话真正意义的机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9277524560c683c9c6b30604676187c944266983b07e0653ea1f894bc69cc94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a66734b3e91e0d2ff7a6583",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宣战！？瞄准C位！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87912b0d37c1d287a9f9446284499a9aeaba2193ba5093da4aec0ef2640c19a1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19175766059c1204ad870887",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了“冠军杯”而开始练习的第一天。\n醒目飞鹰取消练习，\n跑到了河岸边。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccc3c1343695164fdcdd77799dad6263eb15d941ce22011044d6f9ef47d5bd52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
