    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2660610c2220cda94ed62be7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她坦白说出了自己的烦恼。面对在追求顶尖的\n过程中完全无法享受演唱会乐趣的她，\n训练员询问她是否能在这里为自己唱歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f31e98ea297957fb957680eaeed1a7e70d1f0fec5668502877764ab120934768",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046406.json",
