    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d23e50642f60203e98587ac5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只有两人的演唱会让醒目飞鹰\n找回了初衷。她的梦想是\n“想绽放光芒”……仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "295a411df01d8b5d4c90321448d0b47cb468995c3ba0c1528a10afcccfe58772",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1046/storytimeline_501046406.json",
      "json_path": [
