      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最近“沙土无声铃鹿”这个别称在粉丝间\n广为流传。为了不让这名字蒙羞，\n她发誓要努力向上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37e2244d20e6920db1af7a2dc26e43258b11d1836d407125287bfb7cddfe0f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
